  description="Comprehensive Terms of Use and Service Agreement for Saver For TUBE covering ephemeral stream conduit rules, fair use compliance, DMCA safe harbor, and limitation of liability."
  canonicalUrl="https://saverfortube.com/terms-of-use"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-16 space-y-8">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="space-y-3 text-center sm:text-left">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 border border-red-200 dark:border-red-900/60">
        Terms &amp; Conditions Agreement
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
        Terms of Use
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
        Effective / Last Updated: October 2026 &bull; Applies to: https://saverfortube.com
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content Container -->
    <div class="border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900/90 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 space-y-8 leading-relaxed">
      
      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 font-mono">1.</span> Binding Agreement &amp; Eligibility
        </h2>
        <p>
          These Terms of Use ("Terms", "Agreement") constitute a legally binding agreement between you ("User", "you") and <strong>Saver For TUBE</strong> ("we", "us", "our", operating <a href="https://saverfortube.com" class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 hover:underline">https://saverfortube.com</a>).
        </p>
        <p>
          By accessing, browsing, linking to, or using our web-based audio extraction and conversion utilities, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and unconditionally agree to be bound by these Terms and all applicable local, national, and international laws. If you do not agree to every provision of this Agreement, you are strictly prohibited from using the service and must discontinue use immediately.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Age Requirement:</strong> You affirm that you are at least 13 years of age (or the minimum legal age required in your jurisdiction to access online services). If you are under 18, you represent that you have obtained consent from a parent or legal guardian to use this web utility.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 font-mono">2.</span> Nature of Service: Technical Conduit &amp; Zero-Hosting Disclaimer
        </h2>
        <p>
          Saver For TUBE operates solely as an automated, web-based technological conduit and real-time audio transcoding interface. It enables end-users to demux and convert publicly accessible online audio streams in a transient, automated fashion.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc list-inside pl-1 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
          <li><strong>Zero Media Hosting:</strong> Saver For TUBE does NOT store, archive, index, host, broadcast, or distribute any video files, MP3 tracks, or multimedia content on its permanent servers.</li>
          <li><strong>Ephemeral Data Pipeline:</strong> All stream processing occurs in volatile server memory (RAM) and is purged immediately upon delivery to the user's browser. We do not maintain a digital locker or repository of downloaded media.</li>
          <li><strong>Automated Execution:</strong> Our servers act automatically upon user instruction without editorial curation, human pre-screening, or modification of original audio content.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 font-mono">3.</span> Permitted Personal Use &amp; User Warranties (Fair Use Framework)
        </h2>
