          Saver For TUBE is provided strictly for lawful personal, educational, academic, and non-commercial study. Permitted uses include:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside pl-1 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
          <li>Extracting audio from public domain recordings, Creative Commons-licensed audio, or royalty-free soundtrack tracks.</li>
          <li>Archiving personal lectures, educational webinars, speeches, and public discussions for offline research.</li>
          <li>Transcoding video content originally created and owned by the user.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          <strong>User Representation &amp; Warranty:</strong> By submitting any URL into our conversion tool, you expressly represent and warrant that you possess all necessary rights, legal ownership, licenses, or explicit statutory fair-use authorization to convert the target media. You acknowledge that you bear 100% sole legal responsibility for any content processed through your browser session.
        </p>
      </section>

