        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 font-mono">6.</span> DMCA Compliance &amp; Copyright Takedown Procedure (Safe Harbor Notice)
